      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "plan: executionUnit.href moves from the v0.0.2-rc2 release of GeoLabs/KindGrove to the v0.0.2-rc3 release (mangrove-workflow-steps.cwl#export_stac). The rc3 CWL declares the format of its Files (the ipython2cwl format annotation), so the processDescription derived from it changes: contentMediaType application/octet-stream -> image/tiff; application=geotiff (with contentEncoding binary) for the inputs biomass_file and mangrove_mask_file, and application/octet-stream -> application/geo+json (with contentEncoding binary) for the input stac_item, in processDescription.json and processDescription.raw.json.",
